{"5159990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arduz", "steam_appid": 5159990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arduz is a free-to-play 2D MMORPG set in a medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose among different classes and races to create your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Level up, learn spells and develop your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hunt creatures, explore dungeons and open-world areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• PvP battles, duels and faction wars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trade with other players in a living economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Team up with your friends to defeat powerful bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quick sessions: log in, play and progress at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arduz is lightweight, runs on almost any PC and is easy to learn. Join the community and write your own story.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arduz is a free-to-play 2D MMORPG set in a medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose among different classes and races to create your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Level up, learn spells and develop your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hunt creatures, explore dungeons and open-world areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• PvP battles, duels and faction wars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trade with other players in a living economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Team up with your friends to defeat powerful bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quick sessions: log in, play and progress at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arduz is lightweight, runs on